# A zero names the exqlite amalgamation, which the index leaves out for its size.
args: search 'repo:^github\.com/elixir-sqlite/exqlite$ sqlite3VdbeExec'
exit: 0
--- stdout
0 matches  1.1 s
query  repo:^github\.com/elixir-sqlite/exqlite$ sqlite3VdbeExec
--- stderr
sego: note: the contents of 1 file in scope aren't in the search index (1 over 1 MiB):
  c_src/sqlite3.c  9.1 MiB
